{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-01", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses are searches (rather than measurements) whose event selection uses both b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "Eight search analyses have event regions that require both a b-tagged jet object and a missing-transverse-momentum (MET/pTmiss) object (predicate region_requires_object):\n\n- 2006.05880 — Search for top squarks with a Higgs or Z boson\n- 2106.01676 — Search for chargino–neutralino pair production (3 leptons + MET)\n- 2106.14246 — Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos\n- 2107.12553 — Search for chargino–neutralino production with Higgs and W bosons\n- 2112.03161 — Search for heavy resonances decaying to boosted Higgs pairs (leptons + b-quark pair)\n- 2209.07327 — Search for pair production of vector-like quarks (leptonic final states)\n- 2211.08028 — Search for supersymmetry in final states with MET and ≥3 b-jets\n- 2508.13900 — General search for supersymmetric particles with compressed mass spectra\n\nAll are categorized as searches (not measurements), and in each case at least one signal region requires both a b-tagged jet and missing transverse momentum. (Some other b-tagged-jet searches such as 2004.14060, 2010.14293, 2012.03799, 2012.08600, 2102.01444, 2202.08676, 2302.05225, 2506.13565, 2509.22535, 2510.07527, 2511.11853 mention MET in their titles or selections but their regions do not appear to explicitly require a MET object via region_requires_object in this graph.)", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2112.03161", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "b-tagged jet", "limit": 30}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:b-jet | detector_object | b-tagged jet\nhepkg:object:bjet_reco | detector_object | b-tagged jet\nhepkg:object:bjet-tight | detector_object | leading b-tagged jet\nhe"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "missing transverse momentum", "limit": 30}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:met | detector_object | Missing transverse momentum\nhepkg:object:missing_et | detector_object | missing transverse momentum\nhepkg:object:met-particle | object_def"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT arxiv_id, title FROM paper WHERE category='search'"}, "rows": 28, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\n2004.14060 | Search fo"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT predicate, COUNT(*) FROM assertion GROUP BY predicate ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "predicate | COUNT(*)\nobject_has_selection | 1335\nresult_reports_quantity | 1286\nregion_has_selection | 1242\nresult_has_systematic | 1148\nsample_uses_generator | 1061\nregion_requires_object | 1055\nchan"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%b-tag%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%b tag%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%btag%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%b-jet%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%b jet%' ORDER BY kind"}, "rows": 152, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background:total-smooth-mJgamma | background | Total SM background in m_{Jγ} spectrum (single- and double-b-tagged categories)\nhepkg:background:mt_background | backgroun"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%missing transverse%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%met%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%etmiss%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%et miss%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%p_t^miss%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%ptmiss%' ORDER BY kind"}, "rows": 200, "error": null, "truncated": true, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background:flavor_symmetric | background | Flavor-symmetric background (ttbar, WW, Z/gamma*->tautau, tW, hadron-decay leptons)\nhepkg:background:dy_jets_instrumental_met "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT e.entity_id, e.label, e.kind, COUNT(*) AS n\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate='region_requires_object'\n  AND e.kind='detector_object'\n  AND (e.label LIKE '%b-tag%' OR e.label LIKE '%b tag%' OR e.label LIKE '%btag%' OR e.label LIKE '%b-jet%')\nGROUP BY e.entity_id ORDER BY n DESC"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | label | kind | n\nhepkg:object:bjet | b-tagged jet | detector_object | 61\nhepkg:object:b-tagged-jet | b-tagged jet | detector_object | 39\nhepkg:object:b-jet | b-tagged jet | detector_object"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT e.entity_id, e.label, e.kind, COUNT(*) AS n\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate='region_requires_object'\n  AND (e.label LIKE '%missing transverse%' OR e.label LIKE '%ETmiss%' OR e.label LIKE '%Etmiss%' OR e.label LIKE '%E_T^miss%' OR e.label LIKE '%p_T^miss%' OR e.label LIKE '%ptmiss%')\nGROUP BY e.entity_id ORDER BY n DESC"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | label | kind | n\nhepkg:object:met | Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss) | detector_object | 53\nhepkg:object:pt_miss | Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss) | detector_object | 6\nhepkg:"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id\nFROM assertion a\nWHERE a.predicate='region_requires_object'\n  AND a.object_id IN ('hepkg:object:bjet','hepkg:object:b-tagged-jet','hep