{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-01-condition", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses use b-tagged jets (jets identified as containing a b-hadron) in their event selection?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "46 analyses in the graph use b-tagged jets (jets identified as containing a b-hadron) in their event selection. This was determined two ways: (a) assertions where a signal/control region requires a b-tagged-jet object (predicate region_requires_object with a b-tagged jet entity), and (b) papers whose entity occurrences include b-tagged jets as detector objects. The union of these two sets gives the 46 arXiv ids listed below. (A few of these also use b-tagging as a veto, e.g. requiring non-b-tagged jets, which is still b-tagging in the event selection.)", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "b-tagged jet", "limit": 30}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:b-jet | detector_object | b-tagged jet\nhepkg:object:bjet_reco | detector_object | b-tagged jet\nhepkg:object:bjet-tight | detector_object | leading b-tagged jet\nhe"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "a