{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-02", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using an ABCD method, or an ABCD-style sideband or matrix method over independent regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analyses that estimate a background using an ABCD method or an ABCD-style sideband/matrix method over independent regions are:\n\nExplicit ABCD / ABCD-style sideband methods:\n- 2004.01678 (Modified ABCD estimate, Regions A/B/C)\n- 2011.07812 (ABCD data-driven background estimation method)\n- 2012.01581 (ABCD-style ratio method using eight non-overlapping regions A–H)\n- 2207.00348 (Double two-dimensional sideband method)\n- 2404.06204 (Two-dimensional ABCD sideband method, control regions B, C, D)\n- 2511.11853 (ABCD matrix data-driven background estimation with control regions and parametric fits)\n- 2604.27044 (Multidimensional ABCD reweighting technique)\n\nMatrix/sideband methods over independent regions (ABCD-style fake-lepton matrix or mass-sideband estimates):\n- 2006.05880 (fake-factor/matrix method for FNP leptons)\n- 2106.01676, 2202.08676, 2208.12095, 2209.07327, 2307.01094 (data-driven matrix method for fake leptons)\n- 2206.09466 (data-driven sideband/Z-peak extrapolation)\n- 2008.05928 (background fit validated with mass-sideband control samples)\n- 2103.06956 (photon-ID BDT sideband nonprompt control sample)\n- 2401.05299 (charge-misassignment sideband method)\n- 2510.07527 (background from data sidebands of mass distributions)", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2307.01094", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "ABCD method background estimation", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:abcd-method | background_method | ABCD data-driven background estimation method\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) d"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%abcd%' GROUP BY kind"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | COUNT(*)\nbackground_method | 6\nevent_region | 3\nstatistical_method | 1\nsystematic_uncertainty | 2\n(4 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%sideband%' GROUP BY kind"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | COUNT(*)\nbackground_method | 7\nevent_region | 12\nsystematic_uncertainty | 2\n(3 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%sideband%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%matrix%' ORDER BY kind, label"}, "rows": 69, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits\nhepkg:met"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT e.entity_id, e.label, a.paper_id FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix%') ORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | label | paper_id\nhepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate | Modified ABCD estimate | 2004.01678\nhepkg:method:data-driven-fnp | Data-driven fake-factor/matrix method for FNP lepton estimation (t"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": ""}, "rows": 0, "error": "empty query", "truncated": false, "preview": "ERROR: empty query"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.object_id, e.label, a.status, COUNT(*) FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%2d%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix%') GROUP BY a.paper_id, a.object_id, e.label, a.status ORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 19, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | object_id | label | status | COUNT(*)\n2004.01678 | hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate | Modified ABCD estimate | machine_verified | 1\n2006.05880 | hepkg:method:data-driven-fnp | Data-drive"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT eo.paper_id, eo.kind, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE lower(eo.label) LIKE '%abcd%' ORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | kind | label\n2004.01678 | event_region | Modified ABCD estimate: Region A\n2004.01678 | event_region | Modified ABCD estimate: Region B\n2004.01678 | event_region | Modified ABCD estimate: Re"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT arxiv_id, title FROM paper WHERE arxiv_id IN ('2004.01678','2006.05880','2008.05928','2011.07812','2012.01581','2103.06956','2106.01676','2202.08676','2206.09466','2207.00348','2208.12095','2209.07327','2307.01094','2401.05299','2404.06204','2510.07527','2511.11853','2604.27044','2112.03161')"}, "rows": 19, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\n2006.05880 | Search fo"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs", "hepkg:background_method:data_driven_nonprompt_control