{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-04", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses unfold their measured distributions -- that is, correct them back to particle level or truth level?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "13 analyses in the graph unfold their measured distributions back to particle/truth level, as evidenced by their use of unfolding statistical methods (TUnfold, iterative Bayesian/D'Agostini unfolding, fully Bayesian unfolding, profile-likelihood unfolding, SVD unfolding) and/or results explicitly labeled as unfolded differential cross-section measurements: 2001.06899, 2110.11231, 2207.12246, 2208.12095, 2308.02285, 2309.14442, 2312.04450, 2401.05299, 2402.08486, 2404.06204, 2405.18661, 2408.03744, 2506.13565.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2110.11231", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "unfolding", "limit": 30}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:statmethod:tunfold_regularized_unfolding | statistical_method | TUnfold unfolding\nhepkg:statmethod:iterative-bayesian-unfolding | statistical_method | Iterative Bayesian"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%unfold%' GROUP BY kind"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | COUNT(*)\nresult | 10\nsample | 1\nstatistical_method | 17\nsystematic_uncertainty | 7\n(4 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, e.label FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id WHERE a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method' AND lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' ORDER BY a.