{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-05", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses reconstruct a Higgs-boson candidate as a physical object they select on (rather than merely studying Higgs production or decay)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The analyses that reconstruct a Higgs-boson candidate as a physical object they select on (i.e., they define a detector-level Higgs-candidate object and/or require it in their regions) are: 2004.04545 (H→γγ diphoton candidate), 2006.05880 (NN-tagged h→bb jet-pair candidate), 2008.05928 (large-R jet H→bb̄ candidate), 2012.08600 (boosted H→bb large-radius jet), 2103.04956 (four-lepton ZZ/Higgs candidate), 2103.06956 (H→γγ diphoton candidate), 2111.08340 (H-jet / H→bb̄ candidate large-R jet), 2112.03161 (H→bb candidate jet), 2504.13081 (reconstructed Higgs boson candidate), 2602.18611 (boosted H→bb large-radius jet), 2604.27044 (merged and resolved H→bb candidates), and 2605.14245 (H→γγ diphoton candidate). A borderline case is 2304.08962, which reconstructs a di-charmonium (4μ) candidate that its regions require; if that is an H→J/ψJ/ψ search, that candidate is the Higgs candidate, but the graph labels it only as a di-charmonium candidate.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2012.08600", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2504.13081", "2602.18611", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "Higgs boson candidate object", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | detector_object | Higgs boson candidate\nhepkg:object:diphoton | object_definition | Higgs boson candidate\nhepkg:object:higgs_boson | detec"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%candidate%' GROUP BY kind"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | COUNT(*)\nbsm_model | 3\nchannel | 1\ndetector_object | 3\nobject_definition | 1\nobservable | 2\n(5 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%' AND (kind='detector_object' OR kind='object_definition' OR kind='event_region') ORDER BY kind"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | detector_object | Higgs boson candidate (h->bb jet pair, NN-tagged)\nhepkg:object:zz_candidate | detector_object | ZZ candidate (four-lepto"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT predicate, COUNT(*) FROM assertion GROUP BY predicate"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "predicate | COUNT(*)\nbackground_uses_method | 437\nchannel_has_region | 889\nmodel_has_benchmark | 151\nmodel_has_parameter | 409\nobject_has_selection | 1335\npaper_reports_result | 120\nregion_has_selecti"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE kind IN ('detector_object','object_definition','event_region') AND (lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(label) LIKE '% h %candidate%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%candidate%higgs%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h->%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%diphoton%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%hjet%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h-jet%') ORDER BY kind, label"}, "rows": 57, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:diphoton-primary-vertex | detector_object | Diphoton primary vertex\nhepkg:object:diphoton-system | detector_object | Diphoton system\nhepkg:object:diphoton_system "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE kind='detector_object' AND (lower(label) LIKE '%candidate%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%reconstruct%') ORDER BY label"}, "rows": 64, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:w_boson_candidate | detector_object | $W$ boson candidate\nhepkg:object:forward-proton-candidate | detector_object | AFP forward proton candidate\nhepkg:object:anti"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.predicate, a.object_id, e.label, COUNT(DISTINCT a.paper_id) AS npapers FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.predicate IN ('region_requires_object','region_vetoes_object','object_has_selection','result_defines_object') AND e.entity_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet','hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:diphoton_system','hepkg:object:diphoton','hepkg:object:h-candidate-merged','hepkg:object:h-candidate-resolved','hepkg:object:bb_jet','hepkg:object:largeR-jet','hepkg:object:candidate-jet','hepkg:object:large_radius_jet','hepkg:object:dicharmonium_candidate','hepkg:object:resonance-candidate') GROUP BY a.predicate, a.object_id, e.label ORDER BY a.predicate, npapers DESC"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "predicate | object_id | label | npapers\nregion_requires_object | hepkg:object:large_radius_jet | Large-radius jet (boosted H->bb analysis) | 2\nregion_requires_object | hepkg:object:bb_jet | H->bb cand"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT eo.paper_id FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet','hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:diphoton_system','hepkg:object:diphoton','hepkg:object:h-candidate-merged','hepkg:object:h-candidate-resolved','hepkg:object:bb_jet','hepkg:object:largeR-jet','hepkg:object:candidate-jet','hepkg:object:large_radius_jet') ORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id\n2004.04545\n2006.05880\n2008.05928\n2012.08600\n2103.04956\n2103.06956\n2111.08340\n2112.03161\n2504.13081\n2602.18611\n2604.27044\n2605.14245\n(12 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.predicate, a.object_id, e.label, a.paper_id FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.predicate IN ('region_requires_object','result_defines_object') AND e.entity_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet','hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:diphoton_system','hepkg:object:diphoton','hepkg:object:h-candidate-merged','hepkg:object:h-candidate-resolved','hepkg:object:bb_jet','hepkg:object:largeR-jet','hepkg:object:candidate-jet','hepkg:object:large_radius_jet','hepkg:object:dicharmonium_candidate','hepkg:object:resonance-candidate') ORDER BY a.object_id, a.predicate"}, "rows": 36, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "predicate | object_id | label | paper_id\nresult_defines_object | hepkg:object:H-jet | H-jet (jet reconstructed to contain the Higgs boson decay products) | 2111.08340\nregion_requires_object | hepkg:ob"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:wwgamgam_singleH", "hepkg:model:sm-higgs", "hepkg:object:H-jet", "hepkg:object:alfa_track", "hepkg:object:anti-tagged-candidate-jet", "hepkg:object:b_jet_reco", "hepkg:object:bb_jet", "hepkg:object:bjet-reco", "hepkg:object:bplus_candidate", "hepkg:object:candidate-jet", "hepkg:object:companion_muon", "hepkg:object:dicharmonium_candidate", "hepkg:object:dijet_candidate", "hepkg:object:diphoton", "hepkg:object:diphoton-primary-vertex", "hepkg:object:diphoton-system", "hepkg:object:diphoton_system", "hepkg:object:double-tagged-candidate-jet", "hepkg:object:elastic_event_candidate", "hepkg:object:electron-candidate", "hepkg:object:electron-reco", "hepkg:object:electron_reco", "hepkg:object:extra_jet_reco", "hepkg:object:forward-proton-candidate", "hepkg:object:fsr-photon", "hepkg:object:fsr_photon", "hepkg:object:h-candidate-merged", "hepkg:object:h-ca