{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-07", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses have a ttZ background and a control region used to normalise that background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The analyses that have a ttZ background and a control region used to normalise that background are: 2006.05880 (ttZ background with dedicated CR^Z_ttZ control region for ttZ normalisation via profile-likelihood fit), 2110.11231 (ttZ/tZq irreducible background with CR-ttZ control region constraining a free-floating normalisation), 2202.08676 (ttZ irreducible background normalised to data in a 3-lepton ttZ control region), 2004.14060 (tt̄Z background normalised via control-region-based simultaneous profile likelihood fit), and 2012.03799 (tt̄Z background normalised via control-region-based simultaneous likelihood fit). Borderline: 2102.01444 lists tt̄Z with both a control-region data-driven normalisation and a direct-MC estimate; 2012.08600 normalises the combined Z+X (incl. ttZ) background in dedicated trilepton/4-lepton control regions that are not ttZ-specific; 2106.14246 defines a ttZ-enriched control region but estimates the ttX (incl. ttZ) background directly from simulation.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2012.03799", "2110.11231", "2202.08676"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "ttZ background"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background:ttz | background | ttZ irreducible background\nhepkg:process:ttX_background | physics_process | ttX (ttH, ttW, ttZ) background\nhepkg:process:ttbarz-production "}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "control region normalise background"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background_method:cr_normalisation_fit | background_method | Control-region-based background normalisation fit\nhepkg:region:cr-bins | event_region | Control-region (CR) "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.subject_id, a.object_id, e.label\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate='result_estimates_background' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%ttz%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%tt z%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%tt̄z%')\nLIMIT 50"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | subject_id | object_id | label\n2006.05880 | result_estimates_background | hepkg:result:d5288b5bc0407b0b2005d131 | hepkg:background:ttZ-3l | ttZ background (3-lepton selection)\n2"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.subject_id, a.object_id, e.label\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%control%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%normalis%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%normaliz%')\nLIMIT 50"}, "rows": 50, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | subject_id | object_id | label\n2004.14060 | background_uses_method | hepkg:background:zjets | hepkg:method:cr_fit_normalization | Control-region-based background normalisation v"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.subject_id, e.label AS bg_label, a.object_id, m.label AS method_label\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.subject_id\nJOIN entity m ON m.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method'\nAND a.subject_id IN (\n  'hepkg:background:ttZ-3l','hepkg:process:ttz-background','hepkg:background:z_plus_x',\n  'hepkg:background:ew_rare','hepkg:background:ttx_prompt','hepkg:background:ttz-tzq',\n  'hepkg:background:ttz','hepkg:process:ttX_background','hepkg:background:nonprompt_wz_ttz',\n  'hepkg:background:other_ttx_ttz','hepkg:background:ttbarZ'\n)\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | subject_id | bg_label | object_id | method_label\n2004.14060 | hepkg:background:ttbarZ | $t\\bar{t}+Z$ background | hepkg:method:cr_fit_normalization | Control-region-based background normali"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.label\nFROM entity_occurrence eo\nWHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:region:ttz_cr','hepkg:region:3l-ttz-cr','hepkg:region:cr-ttz','hepkg:object:CR-Z-ttZ')\nORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | label\n2006.05880 | hepkg:object:CR-Z-ttZ | Control region CR^Z_ttZ for ttZ background normalisation (3ℓ selection)\n2106.14246 | hepkg:region:ttz_cr | ttZ-enriched control region"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.subject_id, e.label, a.object_id\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate='result_estimates_background'\nAND a.paper_id IN ('2004.14060','2006.05880','2012.03799','2012.08600','2102.01444','2110.11231','2202.08676','2405.18661')\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 47, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | subject_id | label | object_id\n2004.14060 | result_estimates_background | hepkg:result:260119c5314b01ee54efcb2b | $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ background | hepkg:background:zjet"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.subject_id, e.label AS subj_label, a.object_id, o.label AS obj_label\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.subject_id\nJOIN entity o ON o.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.paper_id IN ('2106.14246','2405.18661','2012.08600')\nAND (a.subject_id IN ('hepkg:region:ttz_cr','hepkg:object:CR-Z-ttZ','hepkg:region:cr-ttz','hepkg:region:3l-ttz-cr')\n     OR a.object_id IN ('hepkg:region:ttz_cr','hepkg:object:CR-Z-ttZ','hepkg:region:cr-ttz','hepkg:region:3l-ttz-cr'))\nORDER