{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-08", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses require exactly two electrons OR exactly two muons as alternative selections -- parallel ee and mumu channels, rather than requiring both?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The analyses that require exactly two electrons OR exactly two muons as alternative (parallel) selections are:\n\n- 2511.11853: defines parallel dielectron (e+e-) and dimuon (mu+mu-) channels, with matching ee and mumu signal/control regions (dimuon SR_b, SR_{b+j/b}, CR_j, CR_2j alongside dielectron CR_j^ee, CR_2j^ee, CR_b^ee, CR_{b+j/b}^ee).\n- 2009.14537: exclusive dilepton production measured in two parallel final states, ee+p (electron pair plus tagged forward proton) and μμ+p (muon pair plus tagged forward proton), each with its own fiducial cross-section observable.\n- 2404.06204: Z-boson analysis with parallel detector-level signal regions for Z→ee and Z→μμ.\n- 2201.11585: analysis with parallel Z(ee) and Z(μμ) control regions.\n\nThese analyses run ee and mumu as alternative same-flavor dilepton selections rather than requiring both flavors in one selection.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2009.14537", "2201.11585", "2404.06204", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "exactly two electrons", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:electron | detector_object | electrons\nhepkg:channel:2l1t | channel | 2L1T channel (exactly 2 light leptons, exactly 1 h candidate)\nhepkg:channel:1l2t | channel |"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "exactly two muons", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:final_state:dimuon | channel | Two prompt, isolated, oppositely charged muons\nhepkg:systematic:lepton_reco_id_trigger | systematic_uncertainty | Muons\nhepkg:object:muon "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%exactly two%' GROUP BY kind"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | COUNT(*)\nchannel | 3\nevent_region | 2\n(2 rows)"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 2, "args": {"limit": 30, "text": "dilepton ee or mumu channel"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:final_state:dilepton_ttbar | channel | dilepton channel\nhepkg:final_state:ttz-2l-hadronic-ttbar | channel | dilepton channel\nhepkg:region:bbww_2l | event_region | bbWW d"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%ee%' AND (lower(label) LIKE '%mu%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%μ%') AND lower(label) LIKE '%channel%' LIMIT 50"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:channel:zll_jets | channel | Z(ll)+jets background channel (Z→ee, Z→μμ)\nhepkg:observable:dilepton-mass-spectrum | observable | Dilepton invariant mass (m_ll) spectrum in"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, count(*) FROM entity WHERE (lower(label) LIKE '%ee%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%e+e%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%electron%') AND (lower(label) LIKE '%μμ%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%mumu%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%muon%') GROUP BY kind"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | count(*)\nbackground | 3\nbenchmark | 1\nchannel | 10\ndetector_object | 11\nobservable | 4\nsample | 1\nstatistical_method | 2\nsystematic_uncertainty | 10\n(8 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE kind='channel' AND (lower(label) LIKE '%ee%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%e+e%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%μμ%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%mumu%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%dimuon%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%dielectron%') ORDER BY label LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:channel:dielectron | channel | Dielectron (e+e-) control channel\nhepkg:channel:dimuon | channel | Dimuon (mu+mu-) channel\nhepkg:final_state:vh-dimuon-multilepton | chann"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE kind='event_region' AND (lower(label) LIKE '%ee%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%e+e%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%μμ%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%mumu%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%dimuon%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%dielectron%') ORDER BY label LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 38, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:region:cr-3body-vv | event_region | CR$^{3-body}_{VV}$: three-body diboson control region\nhepkg:region:cr-3body-ttbar | event_region | CR$^{3-body}_{t\\bar t}$: three-bod"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.kind, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:channel:dielectron','hepkg:channel:dimuon','hepkg:region:sr-ee','hepkg:region:z-ee-detector-sr','hepkg:region:z-mumu-detector-sr','hepkg:region:cr_zee','hepkg:region:cr_zmumu','hepkg:final_state:ee-plus-p','hepkg:final_state:mumu-plus-p') ORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | kind | label\n2009.14537 | hepkg:final_state:ee-plus-p | channel | ee+p (electron pair plus tagged forward proton)\n2009.14537 | hepkg:final_state:mumu-plus-p | channel | μμ+p (mu"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.kind, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:region:CR_2j_ee','hepkg:region:CR_b_ee','hepkg:region:CR_j_ee','hepkg:region:CR_b_j_b_ee','hepkg:region:CR_2j','hepkg:region:CR_j','hepkg:region:SR_b','hepkg:region:SR_b_j_b') ORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | kind | label\n2511.11853 | hepkg:region:SR_b | event_region | SR_b: 1-jet dimuon signal region with exactly one b-tagged jet\n2511.11853 | hepkg:region:SR_b_j_b | event_region | S"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%two electrons%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%2 electrons%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%two muons%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%2 muons%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%2e%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%2μ%' LIMIT 50"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:region:zh-leptonic | event_region | ZH leptonic category region (4mu and 2mu2e subchannels)\nhepkg:final_state:four_lepton | channel | Four-lepton final state (4e, 4mu, 2"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%e+e-%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%mu+mu-%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%μ+μ-%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%ee or%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%mumu%' LIMIT 80"}, "rows": 44, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:channel:dilepton_plus_jets | channel | Z(→e+e-/μ+μ-) + jet(s) final state\nhepkg:method:parametric-fit-tth | background_method | Parametric mumu fit background estimation"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:charge-misid", "hepkg:background:cosmic-ray-muons-mumu", "hepkg:background:heavy-flavor-mumu", "hepkg:background:nonprompt-ssdilepton", "hepkg:background:other-minor-backgrounds", "hepkg:background:others", "hepkg:background:prompt-ssdilepton", "hepkg:background:tWZ_tZ", "hepkg:background:z_ll", "hepkg:channel:1l2t", "hepkg:channel:1l3t", "hepkg:channel:2l1t", "hepkg:channel:2l2t", "hepkg:channel:3l_a", "hepkg:channel:3l_b", "hepkg:channel:4l_i", "hepkg:channel:dielectron", "hepkg:channel:dilepton_plus_jets", "hepkg:channel:dimuon", "hepkg:channel:three-body-selection", "hepkg:channel:ttbar_emu", "hepkg:channel:two-body-selection", "hepkg:channel:zll_jets", "hepkg:collision_system:ee_zpo