{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-02", "repeat": 1, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using an ABCD method, or an ABCD-style sideband or matrix method over independent regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "14 analyses estimate a background using an ABCD method, an ABCD-style sideband method, or a data-driven matrix method over independent regions.\n\nABCD / ABCD-style methods: 2004.01678 (modified ABCD estimate), 2011.07812 (ABCD data-driven method), 2012.01581 (ABCD-style ratio method with eight non-overlapping regions A–H), 2404.06204 (2D ABCD sideband method with control regions B, C, D), 2511.11853 (ABCD/matrix data-driven estimation using control regions with parametric fits), 2604.27044 (multidimensional ABCD reweighting).\n\nData-driven matrix methods (tight/loose fake-lepton estimation): 2006.05880, 2106.01676, 2202.08676, 2208.12095, 2209.07327, 2307.01094.\n\nABCD-style sideband methods over independent regions: 2206.09466 (sideband/Z-peak extrapolation), 2207.00348 (double 2D sideband method).", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2006.05880", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2106.01676", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2307.01094", "2404.06204", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "ABCD method background estimation", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:abcd-method | background_method | ABCD data-driven background estimation method\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) d"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%matrix method%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%sideband%' ORDER BY kind"}, "rows": 35, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate | background_method | Modified ABCD estimate\nhepkg:method:data-driven-fnp | background_method | Data-driven fake-factor/matrix method for F"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, e.entity_id, e.label\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate = 'background_uses_method'\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 200, "error": null, "truncated": true, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | label\n2004.01678 | hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate | Modified ABCD estimate\n2004.01678 | hepkg:method:mc-reweighting-correction | MC-based reweighting correction for m_llj-M"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, e.entity_id, e.label\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate = 'background_uses_method'\n  AND e.entity_id IN (\n    'hepkg:method:abcd-method',\n    'hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs',\n    'hepkg:method:data_driven_abcd_ratio',\n    'hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate',\n    'hepkg:method:matrix-method',\n    'hepkg:method:matrix_method',\n    'hepkg:method:data-driven-fnp',\n    'hepkg:background_method:z-multijet-abcd-sideband',\n    'hepkg:method:abcd-reweighting',\n    'hepkg:method:double-2d-sideband',\n    'hepkg:method:data-driven-sideband-extrapolation'\n  )\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 19, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | label\n2004.01678 | hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate | Modified ABCD estimate\n2006.05880 | hepkg:method:data-driven-fnp | Data-driven fake-factor/matrix method for FNP lepton "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity\nWHERE lower(label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%matrix%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%sideband%'\nORDER BY kind, label"}, "rows": 69, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits\nhepkg:met"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT e.entity_id, e.label, COUNT(DISTINCT a.paper_id) AS npapers\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate = 'background_uses_method'\nGROUP BY e.entity_id, e.label\nORDER BY e.label"}, "rows": 200, "error": null, "truncated": true, "preview": "entity_id | label | npapers\nhepkg:method:etmiss-significance-cut | $E_T^{miss}$ significance ($\\mathcal{S}>12$) requirement suppressing multijet background | 1\nhepkg:method:kde_2d_smoothing | 2D kerne"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.label\nFROM entity_occurrence eo\nWHERE eo.entity_id IN (\n  'hepkg:method:abcd-method',\n  'hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs',\n  'hepkg:method:data_driven_abcd_ratio',\n  'hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate',\n  'hepkg:method:matrix-method',\n  'hepkg:method:matrix_method',\n  'hepkg:method:data-driven-fnp',\n  'hepkg:background_method:z-multijet-abcd-sideband',\n  'hepkg:method:abcd-reweighting',\n  'hepkg:method:double-2d-sideband',\n  'hepkg:method:data-driven-sideband-extrapolation'\n)\nORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | label\n2004.01678 | hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate | Modified ABCD estimate\n2006.05880 | hepkg:method:data-driven-fnp | Data-driven fake-factor/matrix method for FNP lepton "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, e.entity_id, e.label\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate = 'background_uses_method'\n  AND e.entity_id IN (\n    'hepkg:method:data_sideband_fit',\n    'hepkg:method:data-driven-background-fit',\n    'hepkg:method:qmisid-data-dri