{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-03", "repeat": 1, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses use the HistFitter framework for their statistical analysis?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Five analyses use the HistFitter framework for their statistical analysis: 2006.05880 (top squark search, profile-likelihood fit and CLs intervals via HistFitter), 2011.07812 (displaced leptons search, HistFitter used for statistical interpretation), 2106.01676 (chargino–neutralino search, profile log-likelihood fit implemented in HistFitter), 2102.01444 (simultaneous likelihood fits using HistFitter and pyhf), and 2211.08028 (SUSY search with ≥3 b-jets, background estimates from a profile likelihood fit implemented in HistFitter). 2401.05299 was checked but only mentions a generic profile-likelihood fit and never uses HistFitter, so it is not included.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2011.07812", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2211.08028"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "HistFitter statistical framework"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:histfitter | statistical_method | HistFitter statistical framework\nhepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter | statistical_method | HistFitter fit\nhepkg:meth"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%histfitter%' LIMIT 30"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:histfitter | statistical_method | HistFitter package with Gaussian nuisance parameters for systematic uncertainties\nhepkg:method:pyhf-combination | statistical_me"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo\nWHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:method:histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit')\nORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | label\n2006.05880 | hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit | Profile likelihood fit implemented in HistFitter\n2006.05880 | hepkg:method:histfitter | HistFitter statistical framework"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, e.label FROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%histfitter%' OR e.entity_id IN ('hepkg:method:histfitter','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter'))\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | label\n2006.05880 | HistFitter package with Gaussian nuisance parameters for systematic uncertainties\n2011.07812 | HistFitter package with Gaussian nuisance parameters for systematic uncerta"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT e.block_id, e.paper_id, substr(e.quote,1,200) AS quote\nFROM evidence e\nWHERE lower(e.quote) LIKE '%histfitter%'\nORDER BY e.paper_id"}, "rows": 0, "error": "no such column: e.paper_id", "truncated": false, "preview": "ERROR: no such column: e.paper_id"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT paper_id, title FROM paper WHERE arxiv_id IN ('2006.05880','2011.07812','2106.01676','2211.08028','2401.05299')"}, "rows": 0, "error": "no such column: paper_id", "truncated": false, "preview": "ERROR: no such column: paper_id"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT bi.paper_arxiv_id, substr(ev.quote,1,150) AS quote\nFROM evidence ev\nJOIN bundle_import bi ON bi.bundle_id = ev.bundle_id\nWHERE lower(ev.quote) LIKE '%histfitter%'\nORDER BY bi.paper_arxiv_id"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_arxiv_id | quote\n2006.05880 | The expected SM background is determined separately in each SR from a profile likelihood fit [ 80 ] implemented in the HistFitter framework [ 81 ] .\n2006.05880 | Th"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT arxiv_id, title FROM paper WHERE arxiv_id IN ('2006.05880','2011.07812','2106.01676','2211.08028','2401.05299')"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title\n2006.05880 | Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n2011.07812 | Search for dis"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT bi.paper_arxiv_id, substr(ev.quote,1,200) AS quote, ev.section_title\nFROM evidence ev\nJOIN bundle_import bi ON bi.bundle_id = ev.bundle_id\nWHERE bi.paper_arxiv_id IN ('2102.01444','2401.05299') AND lower(ev.quote) LIKE '%histfitter%'"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_arxiv_id | quote | section_title\n2102.01444 | A set of simultaneous likelihood fits is performed, for each one of the three different selections, using standard minimisation software packages, H"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, e.label\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.paper_id IN ('2102.01444','2401.05299') AND a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method'\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | label\n2401.05299 | result_uses_statistical_method | Maximum-likelihood (profile likelihood) fit with Poisson/Gaussian terms and Beeston-Barlow-lite MC-stat nuisances\n2401.05299 "}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:simulated_template_backgrounds", "hepkg:method:bayesian-eftfitter-batjl", "hepkg:method:binned-ml-fit", "hepkg:method:bootstrap_correlation_test", "hepkg:method:combine-roofit-roostats", "hepkg:method:histfitter", "hepkg:method:poisson-gaussian-nuisance", "hepkg:method:profile-like