{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-04", "repeat": 1, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses unfold their measured distributions -- that is, correct them back to particle level or truth level?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "13 analyses in the graph unfold their measured distributions back to particle/truth level, identified either by an unfolding statistical method (TUnfold, iterative Bayesian/D'Agostini unfolding, fully Bayesian unfolding, profile-likelihood unfolding, SVD unfolding, binned ML fit for unfolding) or by results explicitly labeled \"unfolded\": 2001.06899, 2110.11231, 2207.12246, 2208.12095, 2308.02285, 2309.14442, 2312.04450, 2401.05299, 2402.08486, 2404.06204, 2405.18661, 2408.03744, 2506.13565.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2110.11231", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "unfolding measured distributions to particle level", "limit": 30}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:unfolding-particle-parton | statistical_method | Unfolding of measurements to particle and parton levels\nhepkg:method:profile-likelihood-unfolding | statistical_m"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%unfold%' GROUP BY kind"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | COUNT(*)\nresult | 10\nsample | 1\nstatistical_method | 17\nsystematic_uncertainty | 7\n(4 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%unfold%' AND kind='result'"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:result:wz-differential-xsec | result | Unfolded differential WZ cross section measurements\nhepkg:result:wminus-pt-5p02tev | result | Measurement of unfolded W- p_T^W dif"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%unfold%' AND kind='statistical_method'"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:binned_maximum_likelihood_fit | statistical_method | Binned maximum likelihood fit for unfolding\nhepkg:method:tunfold_least_squares_unfolding | statistical_method"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT predicate FROM assertion WHERE object_id IN (SELECT entity_id FROM entity WHERE kind='statistical_method') OR subject_id IN (SELECT entity_id FROM entity WHERE kind='statistical_method')"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "predicate\nresult_uses_statistical_method\n(1 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT predicate FROM assertion WHERE predicate LIKE '%statistical%' OR predicate LIKE '%method%'"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "predicate\nbackground_uses_method\nresult_uses_statistical_method\n(2 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, e.label AS method_label\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method'\n  AND e.entity_id IN (\n    'hepkg:method:binned_maximum_likelihood_fit',\n    'hepkg:method:tunfold_least_squares_unfolding',\n    'hepkg:method:tunfold-least-squares-unfolding',\n    'hepkg:method:iterative_unfolding',\n    'hepkg:method:svd_unfolding_crosscheck',\n    'hepkg:method:statistical_covariance_matrix',\n    'hepkg:method:data_driven_closure_test',\n    'hepkg:method:fully_bayesian_unfolding',\n    'hepkg:method:unfolding-particle-parton',\n    'hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-unfolding',\n  