{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-05", "repeat": 1, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses reconstruct a Higgs-boson candidate as a physical object they select on (rather than merely studying Higgs production or decay)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "Twelve analyses reconstruct a Higgs-boson candidate as a physical detector object they select on (each either defines the candidate object in a result via result_defines_object and/or requires it in a region via region_requires_object). They span the main reconstruction modes: H→bb (resolved, merged, and boosted large-R jets), H→γγ (diphoton system), and H→4ℓ (ZZ candidate). The papers are: 2004.04545 (diphoton H→γγ candidate), 2006.05880 (NN-tagged h→bb jet-pair candidate), 2008.05928 (large-R jet H→bb̄ candidate), 2012.08600 (large-radius jet, boosted H→bb), 2103.04956 (ZZ four-lepton Higgs candidate), 2103.06956 (diphoton H→γγ candidate), 2111.08340 (H-jet / candidate large-R jet), 2112.03161 (H→bb candidate jet), 2504.13081 (reconstructed Higgs boson candidate), 2602.18611 (large-radius jet, boosted H→bb), 2604.27044 (merged and resolved H→bb candidates), and 2605.14245 (diphoton Higgs candidate).", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2012.08600", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2504.13081", "2602.18611", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "Higgs boson candidate", "limit": 30}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | detector_object | Higgs boson candidate\nhepkg:object:diphoton | object_definition | Higgs boson candidate\nhepkg:object:higgs_boson | detec"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT predicate, COUNT(*) FROM assertion GROUP BY predicate ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "predicate | COUNT(*)\nobject_has_selection | 1335\nresult_reports_quantity | 1286\nregion_has_selection | 1242\nresult_has_systematic | 1148\nsample_uses_generator | 1061\nregion_requires_object | 1055\nchan"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 2, "args": {"limit": 30, "text": "H boson candidate reconstructed"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:zz_candidate | detector_object | H boson candidate\nhepkg:object:higgs_boson | detector_object | Higgs boson (reconstructed candidate)\nhepkg:object:w-boson | detec"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE kind='detector_object' AND (lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h boson%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h candidate%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%higg%candidate%')"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | detector_object | Higgs boson candidate (h->bb jet pair, NN-tagged)\nhepkg:object:zz_candidate | detector_object | ZZ candidate (four-lepto"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE kind='detector_object' AND (lower(label) LIKE '%candidate%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h boson%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h-jet%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h→bb%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h->bb%') ORDER BY label"}, "rows": 49, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:w_boson_candidate | detector_object | $W$ boson candidate\nhepkg:object:forward-proton-candidate | detector_object | AFP forward proton candidate\nhepkg:object:anti"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE kind='object_definition' AND (lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%candidate%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h boson%') ORDER BY label"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:diphoton | object_definition | Diphoton system (Higgs boson candidate)\nhepkg:object:higgs-boson-particle-level | object_definition | Higgs boson (particle level)\n"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo\nWHERE eo.entity_id IN (\n 'hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet',\n 'hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:h-candidate-merged','hepkg:object:h-candidate-resolved',\n 'hepkg:object:bb_jet','hepkg:object:largeR-jet','hepkg:object:candidate-jet',\n 'hepkg:object:diphoton_system','hepkg:object:large_radius_jet','hepkg:object:diphoton')\nORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | label\n2004.04545 | hepkg:object:diphoton_system | diphoton ($\\gamma\\gamma$) system\n2006.05880 | hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | Higgs boson candidate (h->bb jet pair, NN-ta"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h->bb%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h→bb%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h boson%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h candidate%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h→γγ%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h->γγ%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h→4l%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h->4l%' GROUP BY kind"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | COUNT(*)\nbackground | 15\nbenchmark | 1\nbsm_model | 42\nchannel | 24\ndetector_object | 10\nevent_region | 16\nmodel_parameter | 15\nobject_definition | 2\nobservable | 52\npaper | 24\nphysics_process |"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.predicate, a.paper_id, a.object_id, e.label\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.object_id IN (\n 'hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:H-jet',\n 'hepkg:o