{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-07", "repeat": 1, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses have a ttZ background and a control region used to normalise that background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The analyses that have a ttZ background and a control region used to normalise that background are:\n\n- 2004.14060 (ATLAS all-hadronic stop search): $t\\bar{t}+Z$ background normalised via control-region-based simultaneous profile-likelihood fit, using the dedicated CRTTZ control region.\n- 2006.05880 (ATLAS top-squark search with Higgs/Z): ttZ background (3-lepton selection) normalised via control-region profile-likelihood fit extrapolated to the SR, using the CR^Z_ttZ control region.\n- 2110.11231 (CMS WZ cross-section measurement): ttZ/tZq irreducible background with free-floating normalisation constrained via a dedicated control region in a combined fit, using the CR-ttZ control region.\n- 2202.08676 (CMS inclusive nonresonant multilepton search): ttZ irreducible background normalised to data in dedicated control regions, using the 3L ttZ control region.\n\nOther papers with ttZ backgrounds (e.g. 2106.14246, 2401.05299, 2012.08600) treat ttZ as part of a combined ttX/Z+X background or lack a graph link showing the ttZ background is normalised via a dedicated ttZ control region, so they are not counted.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2110.11231", "2202.08676"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "ttZ background"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background:ttz | background | ttZ irreducible background\nhepkg:process:ttX_background | physics_process | ttX (ttH, ttW, ttZ) background\nhepkg:process:ttbarz-production "}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "control region normalise background"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background_method:cr_normalisation_fit | background_method | Control-region-based background normalisation fit\nhepkg:region:cr-bins | event_region | Control-region (CR) "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, e.entity_id, e.label, e.kind\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate = 'result_estimates_background'\n  AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%ttz%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%tt z%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%ttbar z%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%tt¯z%')\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | entity_id | label | kind\n2006.05880 | result_estimates_background | hepkg:background:ttZ-3l | ttZ background (3-lepton selection) | background\n2009.04363 | result_estimates_back"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, e.entity_id, e.label, e.kind\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate = 'background_uses_method'\n  AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%control%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%normaliz%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%normalis%')\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 200, "error": null, "truncated": true, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | entity_id | label | kind\n2004.14060 | background_uses_method | hepkg:method:cr_fit_normalization | Control-region-based background normalisation via simultaneous profile likelih"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.kind, eo.label\nFROM entity_occurrence eo\nWHERE lower(eo.label) LIKE '%ttz%' AND (eo.kind='event_region' OR eo.kind='detector_object')\nORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | kind | label\n2004.14060 | hepkg:region:crttz | event_region | CRTTZ\n2006.05880 | hepkg:object:CR-Z-ttZ | detector_object | Control region CR^Z_ttZ for ttZ background normalisati"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT e.entity_id, e.label, e.kind\nFROM entity e\nWHERE (lower(e.label) LIKE '%ttz%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%tt z%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%ttbar z%')\n  AND (e.kind='event_region' OR e.kind='detector_object' OR e.kind='channel')\nORDER BY e.kind, e.label"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | label | kind\nhepkg:object:CR-Z-ttZ | Control region CR^Z_ttZ for ttZ background normalisation (3ℓ selection) | detector_object\nhepkg:object:VR-Z-ttZ | Validation region VR^Z_ttZ for ttZ ba"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, e.entity_id, e.label, e.kind\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate = 'result_estimates_background'\n  AND a.paper_id IN ('2004.14060','2106.14246','2401.05299','2006.05880','2110.11231','2202.08676')\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 42, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | entity_id | label | kind\n2004.14060 | result_estimates_background | hepkg:background:zjets | $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ background | background\n2004.14060 | result_estimates_b"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, sub.label AS subj_label, sub.kind AS subj_kind, obj.label AS obj_label, obj.kind AS obj_kind\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity sub ON sub.entity_id = a.subject_id\nJOIN entity obj ON obj.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE (lower(sub.label) LIKE '%ttz%' OR lower(obj.label) LIKE '%ttz%')\n  AND a.predicate IN ('region_has_selection','object_has_selection','channel_has_region','result_defines_region','result_has_channel','background_uses_method')\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 34, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | subj_label | subj_kind | obj_label | obj_kind\n2004.14060 | channel_has_region | All-hadronic multi-jet + missing transverse momentum final state (zero electrons/muons, one or tw"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, sub.label AS subj_label, sub.kind AS subj_kind, obj.label AS obj_label, obj.kind AS obj_kind\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity sub ON sub.entity_id = a.subject_id\nJOIN entity obj ON obj.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate = 'background_uses_method'\n  AND a.paper_id IN ('2004.14060','2006.05880','2110.11231','2202.08676','2106.14246','2401.05299','2012.08600','2405.18661','2009.04363')\nORDER BY a.paper_id, subj_label"}, "rows": 67, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | subj_label | subj_kind | obj_label | obj_kind\n2004.14060 | $W$+jets background | background | Control-region-based background normalisation via simultaneous profile likelihood fit | backgro"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, sub.label AS subj_label, sub.kind AS subj_kind, obj.label AS obj_label, obj.kind AS obj_kind\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity sub ON sub.entity_id = a.subject_id\nJOIN entity obj ON obj.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE (sub.entity_id IN ('hepkg:region:crttz','hepkg:object:CR-Z-ttZ','hepkg:region:ttz_cr','hepkg:region:cr-ttz','hepkg:region:3l-ttz-cr')\n    OR obj.entity_id IN ('hepkg:region:crttz','hepkg:object:CR-Z-ttZ','hepkg:region:ttz_cr','hepkg:region:cr-ttz','hepkg:region:3l-ttz-cr'))\nORDER BY a.paper_id, a.predicate"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | subj_label | subj_kind | obj_label | obj_kind\n2004.14060 | channel_has_region | All-hadronic multi-jet + missing transverse momentum final state (zero electrons/muons, one or tw"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:charge_misid", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:ew_rare", "hepkg:background:fnp-lepton", "hepkg:background:internal-conversion", "hepkg:background:material-conversion", "hepkg:background:misid-lepton", "hepkg:background:multiboson-3l", "hepkg:background:multiboson_prompt", "hepkg:background