{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-08", "repeat": 1, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses require exactly two electrons OR exactly two muons as alternative selections -- parallel ee and mumu channels, rather than requiring both?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "Based on my investigation, I found analyses with parallel ee and mumu channels (separate same-flavor dilepton selections, rather than a combined ee+μμ selection).\n\n**2009.14537** — has two parallel channels: `ee+p` (electron pair plus tagged forward proton) and `μμ+p` (muon pair plus tagged forward proton), both linked to the same result via `result_has_channel`. This is a clear ee/mumu parallel-channel design.\n\n**2404.06204** — has parallel detector-level signal regions `z-ee-detector-sr` (\"Z → ee selection\") and `z-mumu-detector-sr` (\"Z → μμ selection\"), i.e., separate exactly-two-electron and exactly-two-muon selections.\n\n**2011.07812** — the displaced-dilepton search defines parallel signal regions `sr-ee` (SR-ee) and `sr-mumu` (SR-μμ) as alternative same-flavor selections (it also has an sr-emu region).\n\nBy contrast, 2208.12095 and 2001.06899 combine ee and μμ into single dilepton regions (e.g., \"Dilepton ee+μμ\" and \"Z(→e+e-/μ+μ-)+jets\"), which is the \"requiring both/combined\" design", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2208.12095", "2404.06204", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "exactly two electrons", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:electron | detector_object | electrons\nhepkg:channel:2l1t | channel | 2L1T channel (exactly 2 light leptons, exactly 1 h candidate)\nhepkg:channel:1l2t | channel |"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "exactly two muons", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:final_state:dimuon | channel | Two prompt, isolated, oppositely charged muons\nhepkg:systematic:lepton_reco_id_trigger | systematic_uncertainty | Muons\nhepkg:object:muon "}, {"tool": "search", "round": 2, "args": {"limit": 30, "text": "ee channel dielectron"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:channel:dielectron | channel | Dielectron (e+e-) control channel\nhepkg:object:dielectron_vertex | detector_object | Dielectron vertex\nhepkg:final_state:ee-plus-p | chann"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 2, "args": {"limit": 30, "text": "mumu channel dimuon"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:channel:dimuon | channel | Dimuon (mu+mu-) channel\nhepkg:final_state:mumu-plus-p | channel | dimuon + proton\nhepkg:final_state:h_to_mumu | channel | H -> mu mu (dimuon)\n"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE kind='channel' AND (lower(label) LIKE '%ee%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%mumu%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%dimuon%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%dielectron%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%e+e-%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%mu+mu-%') ORDER BY label"}, "rows": 23, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:channel:dielectron | channel | Dielectron (e+e-) control channel\nhepkg:channel:dimuon | channel | Dimuon (mu+mu-) channel\nhepkg:final_state:vh-dimuon-multilepton | chann"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE kind='event_region' AND (lower(label) LIKE '%ee%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%mumu%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%dimuon%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%dielectron%') ORDER BY label"}, "rows": 37, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:region:cr-3body-vv | event_region | CR$^{3-body}_{VV}$: three-body diboson control region\nhepkg:region:cr-3body-ttbar | event_region | CR$^{3-body}_{t\\bar t}$: three-bod"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:channel:dielectron','hepkg:channel:dimuon','hepkg:channel:dilepton_plus_jets','hepkg:final_state:ee-plus-p','hepkg:final_state:mumu-plus-p','hepkg:final_state:displaced-dilepton') ORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | label\n2001.06899 | hepkg:channel:dilepton_plus_jets | Z(→e+e-/μ+μ-) + jet(s) final state\n2009.14537 | hepkg:final_state:ee-plus-p | ee+p (electron pair plus tagged forward proto"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:region:CR_2j_ee','hepkg:region:CR_j_ee','hepkg:region:CR_b_ee','hepkg:region:CR_b_j_b_ee','hepkg:region:CR_2j','hepkg:region:CR_j','hepkg:region:SR_b','hepkg:region:SR_b_j_b','hepkg:region:sr-ee','hepkg:region:z-ee-detector-sr','hepkg:region:z-mumu-detector-sr','hepkg:region:dl_eeMumu_1b_excl','hepkg:region:dl_eeMumu_2b_incl') ORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | label\n2011.07812 | hepkg:region:sr-ee | SR-ee signal region\n2208.12095 | hepkg:region:dl_eeMumu_1b_excl | Dilepton $ee+\\mu\\mu$, 1$b$-tag-exclusive region\n2208.12095 | hepkg:regi"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.subject_id, a.object_id, e.label FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id WHERE a.paper_id IN ('2009.14537','2511.11853','2404.06204','2208.12095','2011.07812') AND a.predicate IN ('channel_has_region','result_defines_region','result_has_channel') ORDER BY a.paper_id, a.predicate LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 110, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | subject_id | object_id | label\n2009.14537 | channel_has_region | hepkg:final_state:ee-plus-p | hepkg:region:preselection | Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Ta"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.subject_id, a.object_id, e.label FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id WHERE a.paper_id IN ('2009.14537','2511.11853','2404.06204','2208.12095','2011.07812') AND a.predicate IN ('region_has_selection','object_has_selection') ORDER BY a.paper_id, a.predicate LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 0, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "0 rows."}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:others", "hepkg:channel:1l2t", "hepkg:channel:1l3t", "hepkg:channel:2l1t", "hepkg:channel:2l2t", "hepkg:channel:3l_a", "hepkg:channel:3l_b", "hepkg:channel:4l_i", "hepkg:channel:dielectron", "hepkg:channel:dilepton_plus_jets", "hepkg:channel:dimuon", "hepkg:channel:flavor-aligned-ml-based", "hepkg:channel:gamma_jets", "hepkg:channel:merged-topology", "hepkg:channel:resolved-topology", "hepkg:channel:sl", "hepkg:channel:three-body-selection", "hepkg:channel:ttbar_emu", "hepkg:channel:two-body-selection", "hepkg:channel:w_to_e", "hepkg:channel:w_to_lnu", "hepkg:channel:w_to_mu", "hepkg:channel:zll_jets", "hepkg:final-state:dilepton-1b", "hepkg:final_state:0L_fully_hadronic", "hepkg:final_state:2L_dilepton", "hepkg:final_state:2l-os-jets-met", "hepkg:final_state:2l-ss", "hepkg:final_state:3l", "hepkg:final_state:3l-met", "hepkg:final_state:4l", "hepkg:final_state:dilepton_ttbar", "hepkg:final_state:dimuon", "hepkg:final_state:displaced-dilepton", "hepkg:final_state:ee-plus-p", "hepkg:final_state:emu_os_1or2_bjets_reco", "hepkg:final_state:emu_ss_1or2_bjets_reco", "hepkg:final_state:ggh-dimuon-untagged", "hepkg:final_state:h_to_gammagamma", "hepkg:final_state:h_to_mumu", "hepkg:final_state:multilepton", "hepkg:final_state:multilepton-3plus", "hepkg:final_state:mumu-plus-p", "hepkg:final_state:single_lepton_ttbar", "hepkg:final_state:ss2l-jets-rpv", "hepkg:final_state:ss2l-or-3l-jets-met", "hepkg:final_state:three_lepton", "