{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-01", "repeat": 2, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses are searches (rather than measurements) whose event selection uses both b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The searches whose event selection uses both b-tagged jets and missing transverse momentum are:\n\n- 2004.14060: \"Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic tt̄ plus missing transverse momentum final state\" — its all-hadronic channel explicitly requires one or two b-tagged jets plus missing transverse momentum.\n- 2102.01444: \"Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum\" — multiple signal/control/validation regions require the b-tagged jet object, with MET in the final state.\n- 2106.01676: \"Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum\" — its ttbar validation regions require b-tagged jets, and the selection uses missing transverse momentum.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2102.01444", "2106.01676"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "b-tagged jet", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:b-jet | detector_object | b-tagged jet\nhepkg:object:bjet_reco | detector_object | b-tagged jet\nhepkg:object:bjet-tight | detector_object | leading b-tagged jet\nhe"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "missing transverse momentum", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:met | detector_object | Missing transverse momentum\nhepkg:object:missing_et | detector_object | missing transverse momentum\nhepkg:object:met-particle | object_def"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%b-tag%' GROUP BY kind"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | COUNT(*)\nbackground | 1\nbackground_method | 1\nchannel | 11\ndetector_object | 19\nevent_region | 16\nobservable | 1\nselection_requirement | 1\nsystematic_uncertainty | 12\n(8 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%missing transverse momentum%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%etmiss%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%met%' GROUP BY kind"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | COUNT(*)\nbackground | 6\nbackground_method | 50\nbenchmark | 2\nbsm_model | 15\nchannel | 28\ndetector_object | 14\nevent_region | 16\ngenerator | 1\nmodel_parameter | 7\nobject_definition | 3\nobservabl"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%b-tag%' ORDER BY kind, label"}, "rows": 62, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background:total-smooth-mJgamma | background | Total SM background in m_{Jγ} spectrum (single- and double-b-tagged categories)\nhepkg:method:ancillary_category_fit_bkg_co"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%missing transverse momentum%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%etmiss%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%e_t^miss%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%p_t^miss%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%ptmiss%' ORDER BY kind, label"}, "rows": 78, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background:dy_jets_instrumental_met | background | DY+jets background with instrumental p_T^miss\nhepkg:background:z_plus_x | background | Z+X background (VZ, ttZ; genuin"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT predicate, COUNT(*) FROM assertion GROUP BY predicate"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "pr