{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-02", "repeat": 2, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using an ABCD method, or an ABCD-style sideband or matrix method over independent regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph contains several background_method entities describing ABCD or ABCD-style sideband/matrix methods over independent regions (e.g. hepkg:method:abcd-method, hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs, hepkg:method:data_driven_abcd_ratio, hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate, hepkg:method:abcd-reweighting, hepkg:background_method:z-multijet-abcd-sideband, hepkg:method:double-2d-sideband). However, I was unable to complete the join from these method entities to the papers that use them (via assertion predicate 'background_uses_method' / entity_occurrence) before the query budget ran out, so I cannot name the specific analyses with verified arXiv IDs.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "ABCD method background estimation", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:abcd-method | background_method | ABCD data-driven background estimation method\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) d"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%matrix method%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%sideband%' ORDER BY kind, label"}, "rows": 35, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits\nhepkg:met"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": 