{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-04", "repeat": 2, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses unfold their measured distributions -- that is, correct them back to particle level or truth level?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analyses that unfold their measured distributions back to particle/truth level are those that use unfolding statistical methods (TUnfold, iterative Bayesian/D'Agostini unfolding, profile-likelihood unfolding, fully Bayesian unfolding, SVD unfolding, etc.): 2001.06899 (Z+charm/bottom jets), 2110.11231 (WZ production), 2207.12246 (elastic scattering total cross section and rho-parameter), 2208.12095 (ttbar charge asymmetry), 2308.02285 (W+c production), 2309.14442 (ttbb production), 2312.04450 (ttZ production), 2401.05299 (ttW production), 2402.08486 (tt + jets differential), 2404.06204 (W/Z pT spectra), 2408.03744 (W/Z inclusive cross sections), and 2506.13565 (dilepton + b-jets search, TUnfold bin-by-bin migration correction). Paper 2405.18661 is a CMS programme report that references unfolded ttbar cross-section results but is not itself an unfolding analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2110.11231", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "unfolding measured distributions to particle level", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:unfolding-particle-parton | statistical_method | Unfolding of measurements to particle and parton levels\nhepkg:method:profile-likelihood-unfolding | statistical_m"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%unfold%' GROUP BY kind"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | COUNT(*)\nresult | 10\nsample | 1\nstatistical_method | 17\nsystematic_uncertainty | 7\n(4 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, label FROM entity WHERE kind='statistical_method' AND lower(label) LIKE '%unfold%'"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | label\nhepkg:method:binned_maximum_likelihood_fit | Binned maximum likelihood fit for unfolding\nhepkg:method:tunfold_least_squares_unfolding | TUnfold least-squares unfolding of differentia"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, label FROM entity WHERE kind='result' AND lower(label) LIKE '%unfold%'"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | label\nhepkg:result:wz-differential-xsec | Unfolded differential WZ cross section measurements\nhepkg:result:wminus-pt-5p02tev | Measurement of unfolded W- p_T^W differential cross section a"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, e.label AS method_label\nFROM assertion a\nJOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method'\n  AND lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%'\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 22, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | method_label\n2001.06899 | Binned maximum likelihood fit for unfolding\n2001.06899 | TUnfold least-squares unfolding of differential distributions\n2110.11231 | TUnfold least-squares regulariz"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT eo.paper_id, eo.label\nFROM entity_occurrence eo\nWHERE eo.kind='statistical_method' AND lower(eo.label) LIKE '%unfold%'\nORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | label\n2001.06899 | TUnfold least-squares unfolding of differential distributions\n2110.11231 | TUnfold least-squares regularized unfolding with area constraint\n2207.12246 | Iterative dynamic"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.label, eo.kind FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.paper_id='2408.03744' AND lower(eo.label) LIKE '%unfold%'"}, "rows": 0, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "0 rows."}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT eo.paper_id, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.kind='result' AND lower(eo.label) LIKE '%unfold%' ORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | label\n2110.11231 | Unfolded differential WZ cross section measurements\n2404.06204 | Measurement of unfolded W- p_T^W differential cross section at sqrt(s)=5.02 TeV\n2404.06204 | Measurement "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT arxiv_id, title FROM paper WHERE arxiv_id IN ('2408.03744','2405.18661','2001.06899','2110.11231','2207.12246','2208.12095','2308.02285','2309.14442','2312.04450','2401.05299','2402.08486','2404.06204','2506.13565')"}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\n2110.11231 | Measu"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT eo.paper_id, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE lower(eo.label) LIKE '%truth level%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%particle level%' ORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | label\n2103.04956 | H->4l fiducial phase space (particle level)\n2207.00348 | Higgs boson (particle level)\n2207.00348 | 45 STXS analysis regions (particle level, used for categorization desig"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:asimov-closure-test", "hepkg:method:binned_maximum_likelihood_fit", "hepkg:method:chi2-compatibility-test", "hepkg:method:data_driven_closure_test", "hepkg:method:fully_bayesian_unfolding", "hepkg:method:iterative_unfolding", "hepkg:me