{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-05", "repeat": 2, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses reconstruct a Higgs-boson candidate as a physical object they select on (rather than merely studying Higgs production or decay)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "Eleven analyses reconstruct a Higgs-boson candidate as a physical detector object and select on it (via object_has_selection, region_requires_object, or result_defines_object), rather than only studying Higgs production/decay as a process. These include H→bb candidate jets (resolved and merged), four-lepton ZZ Higgs candidates, H→γγ diphoton systems, and boosted H→bb large-radius jets: 2004.04545, 2006.05880, 2008.05928, 2103.04956, 2103.06956, 2111.08340, 2112.03161, 2504.13081, 2602.18611, 2604.27044, 2605.14245. Excluded: 2012.08600 (its large-radius jet is a W/Z boson candidate, not a Higgs candidate) and 2207.00348 (its diphoton system is not labeled as a Higgs candidate).", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2504.13081", "2602.18611", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "Higgs boson candidate object", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | detector_object | Higgs boson candidate\nhepkg:object:diphoton | object_definition | Higgs boson candidate\nhepkg:object:higgs_boson | detec"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, COUNT(*) FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%candidate%' GROUP BY kind"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | COUNT(*)\nbsm_model | 3\nchannel | 1\ndetector_object | 3\nobject_definition | 1\nobservable | 2\n(5 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, label FROM entity WHERE kind='detector_object' AND (lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h boson%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h candidate%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h->%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h boson%')"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | label\nhepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | Higgs boson candidate (h->bb jet pair, NN-tagged)\nhepkg:object:large_radius_jet | Large-radius jet (boosted H->bb analysis)\nhepkg:object:zz_candi"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, label, kind FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%candidate%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%h boson candidate%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%higgs boson (reconstructed%'"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | label | kind\nhepkg:final_state:1lepton-4b-higgs-met | Exactly one lepton plus ≥4 b-tagged jets including a Higgs boson candidate (h→bb̄) and missing transverse momentum | channel\nhepkg:obj"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.predicate, a.subject_id, a.object_id, a.paper_id FROM assertion a WHERE a.subject_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:H-jet','hepkg:object:bb_jet','hepkg:object:h-candidate-resolved','hepkg:object:h-candidate-merged','hepkg:object:diphoton') OR a.object_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:H-jet','hepkg:object:bb_jet','hepkg:object:h-candidate-resolved','hepkg:object:h-candidate-merged','hepkg:object:diphoton')"}, "rows": 39, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "predicate | subject_id | object_id | paper_id\nobject_has_selection | hepkg:object:bb_jet |  | 2112.03161\nobject_has_selection | hepkg:object:bb_jet |  | 2112.03161\nobject_has_selection | hepkg:object:"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.kind, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate','hepkg:object:zz_candidate','hepkg:object:higgs_boson','hepkg:object:H-jet','hepkg:object:bb_jet','hepkg:object:h-candidate-resolved','hepkg:object:h-candidate-merged','hepkg:object:diphoton')"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | kind | label\n2006.05880 | hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate | detector_object | Higgs boson candidate (h->bb jet pair, NN-tagged)\n2103.04956 | hepkg:object:zz_candidate | detec"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 4, "args": {"limit": 30, "text": "Higgs candidate reconstructed object H->bb H->gamma gamma H->ZZ H->WW"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:higgs_boson | detector_object | Higgs boson (reconstructed candidate)\nhepkg:object:diphoton | object_definition | H->gamma gamma candidate\nhepkg:object:higgs-boso"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, label, kind FROM entity WHERE kind='detector_object' AND (lower(label) LIKE '%h->%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%higgs%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%diphoton%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%four-lepton%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%4l%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%candidate%')"}, "rows": 51, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | label | kind\nhepkg:object:z_candidate | Z boson candidate (dilepton system) | detector_object\nhepkg:object:diphoton_system | Diphoton system (H→γγ candidate) | detector_object\nhepkg:object"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.kind, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:object:diphoton_system','hepkg:object:largeR-jet','hepkg:object:candidate-jet','hepkg:object:double-tagged-candidate-jet','hepkg:object:anti-tagged-candidate-jet','hepkg:object:large_radius_jet','hepkg:object:diphoton-system')"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | kind | label\n2004.