{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-07", "repeat": 2, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses have a ttZ background and a control region used to normalise that background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The analyses that have a ttZ background and a control region used to normalise that background are:\n\n- 2004.14060 (CMS ttZ measurement): estimates a ttbar+Z background, defines the CRTTZ control region, and uses control-region-based background normalisation via a simultaneous profile-likelihood fit.\n- 2006.05880 (CMS ttZ, 3-lepton): estimates the ttZ background (3-lepton selection), defines CR^Z_ttZ explicitly labelled \"Control region CR^Z_ttZ for ttZ background normalisation (3ℓ selection)\", and uses control-region normalisation via profile-likelihood fit extrapolated to the signal region.\n- 2110.11231: estimates the ttZ and tZq irreducible background and defines the ttZ/tZq control region CR-ttZ.\n- 2202.08676 (ATLAS ttZ): estimates the ttZ irreducible background and defines the 3L ttZ control region.\n\nOther papers with ttZ-related backgrounds or ttZ-enriched regions (e.g. 2106.14246, 2012.08600) do not clearly show a control region dedicated to normalising the ttZ background in the graph, so they are not included.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2110.11231", "2202.08676"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "ttZ background"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background:ttz | background | ttZ irreducible background\nhepkg:process:ttX_background | physics_process | ttX (ttH, ttW, ttZ) background\nhepkg:process:ttbarz-production "}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "control region normalise background"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background_method:cr_normalisation_fit | background_method | Control-region-based background normalisation fit\nhepkg:region:cr-bins | event_region | Control-region (CR) "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.object_id, e.label, e.kind\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate='result_estimates_background'\n  AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%ttz%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%tt z%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%ttbar z%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%tt¯z%')\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | object_id | label | kind\n2006.05880 | result_estimates_background | hepkg:background:ttZ-3l | ttZ background (3-lepton selection) | background\n2009.04363 | result_estimates_back"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.object_id, e.label, e.kind\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE (lower(e.label) LIKE '%ttz%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%tt z%')\n  AND e.kind IN ('event_region','detector_object')\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 26, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | object_id | label | kind\n2004.14060 | result_defines_region | hepkg:region:crttz | CRTTZ | event_region\n2004.14060 | channel_has_region | hepkg:region:crttz | CRTTZ | event_regi"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT predicate FROM assertion"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "predicate\nbackground_uses_method\nchannel_has_region\nmodel_has_benchmark\nmodel_has_parameter\nobject_has_selection\npaper_reports_result\nregion_has_selection\nregion_requires_object\nregion_vetoes_object\nr"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.subject_id, a.object_id, e.label, e.kind\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.subject_id IN ('hepkg:region:crttz','hepkg:object:CR-Z-ttZ','hepkg:region:ttz_cr','hepkg:region:cr-ttz','hepkg:region:3l-ttz-cr','hepkg:region:sr-3l-ttz')\nORDER BY a.paper_id, a.subject_id"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | subject_id | object_id | label | kind\n2004.14060 | region_requires_object | hepkg:region:crttz | hepkg:object:electron_control | Control (tight) electron | detector_object\n2004."}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.object_id, e.label, e.kind\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.paper_id='2004.14060' AND a.predicate='result_estimates_background'"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | object_id | label | kind\n2004.14060 | result_estimates_background | hepkg:background:zjets | $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ background | background\n2004.14060 | result_estimates_b"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.object_id, e.label, e.kind\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method'\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 200, "error": null, "truncated": true, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | object_id | label | kind\n2004.01678 | background_uses_method | hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate | Modified ABCD estimate | background_method\n2004.01678 | background_uses_meth"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, a.predicate, a.object_id, e.label, e.kind\nFROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id = a.object_id\nWHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND a.paper_id IN ('2006.05880','2106.14246','2110.11231','2202.08676','2004.14060','2009.04363','2012.08600','2103.04956','2309.14442','2405.18661')\nORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 72, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | object_id | label | kind\n2004.14060 | background_uses_method | hepkg:method:cr_fit_normalization | Control-region