{"run_id": "20260830T111332-free-sql-168561", "qid": "gabriel-gf-08", "repeat": 2, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses require exactly two electrons OR exactly two muons as alternative selections -- parallel ee and mumu channels, rather than requiring both?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The analyses that require exactly two electrons OR exactly two muons as alternative (parallel) selections are:\n\n- 2511.11853: has both a Dimuon (μ+μ-) channel and a Dielectron (e+e-) control channel, with parallel dimuon signal/control regions (SR_b, SR_b_j_b, CR_j, CR_2j) and dielectron control regions (CR_b_ee, CR_j_ee, CR_2j_ee, CR_b_j_b_ee).\n- 2009.14537: parallel ee+p (electron pair plus tagged forward proton) and μμ+p (muon pair plus tagged forward proton) channels.\n- 2404.06204: parallel detector-level signal regions for Z→ee and Z→μμ selections.\n- 2201.11585: parallel Z(ee) and Z(μμ) control regions (Z(ll)+jets background, Z→ee / Z→μμ).\n\nNote: 2208.12095 also accepts ee or μμ dileptons but combines them into single \"Dilepton ee+μμ\" regions rather than keeping separate parallel channels, so it is not counted here.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2009.14537", "2201.11585", "2404.06204", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "exactly two electrons", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object:electron | detector_object | electrons\nhepkg:channel:2l1t | channel | 2L1T channel (exactly 2 light leptons, exactly 1 h candidate)\nhepkg:channel:1l2t | channel |"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "exactly two muons", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:final_state:dimuon | channel | Two prompt, isolated, oppositely charged muons\nhepkg:systematic:lepton_reco_id_trigger | systematic_uncertainty | Muons\nhepkg:object:muon "}, {"tool": "search", "round": 2, "args": {"limit": 20, "text": "ee or mumu dilepton channel"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:final_state:dilepton_ttbar | channel | dilepton channel\nhepkg:final_state:ttz-2l-hadronic-ttbar | channel | dilepton channel\nhepkg:region:detector_sr_dilepton | event_re"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 2, "args": {"limit": 20, "text": "same flavor opposite sign dilepton"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:final_state:2l-ss | channel | same-sign dilepton\nhepkg:final_state:z_to_dilepton | channel | Z -> dilepton (same-flavor, opposite-charge lepton pair)\nhepkg:final_state:s"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id, kind, label FROM entity WHERE (lower(label) LIKE '%ee%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%mumu%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%dimuon%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%dielectron%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%e+e-%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%mu+mu-%') AND kind IN ('channel','event_region') ORDER BY kind, label LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:channel:dielectron | channel | Dielectron (e+e-) control channel\nhepkg:channel:dimuon | channel | Dimuon (mu+mu-) channel\nhepkg:final_state:vh-dimuon-multilepton | chann"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 3, "args": {"limit": 20, "text": "dielectron channel"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:channel:dielectron | channel | Dielectron (e+e-) control channel\nhepkg:object:dielectron_vertex | detector_object | Dielectron vertex\nhepkg:final_state:ee-plus-p | chann"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.kind, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:channel:dielectron','hepkg:channel:dimuon','hepkg:region:sr-ee','hepkg:region:z-ee-detector-sr','hepkg:region:z-mumu-detector-sr','hepkg:region:dl_eeMumu_1b_excl','hepkg:region:dl_eeMumu_2b_incl') ORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | kind | label\n2011.07812 | hepkg:region:sr-ee | event_region | SR-ee signal region\n2208.12095 | hepkg:region:dl_eeMumu_1b_excl | event_region | Dilepton $ee+\\mu\\mu$, 1$b$-tag-exc"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.kind, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:region:CR_2j_ee','hepkg:region:CR_2j','hepkg:region:CR_b_ee','hepkg:region:CR_b','hepkg:region:CR_j_ee','hepkg:region:CR_j','hepkg:region:CR_b_j_b_ee','hepkg:region:CR_b_j_b','hepkg:region:SR_b','hepkg:region:SR_b_j_b') ORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | kind | label\n2511.11853 | hepkg:region:SR_b | event_region | SR_b: 1-jet dimuon signal region with exactly one b-tagged jet\n2511.11853 | hepkg:region:SR_b_j_b | event_region | S"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.kind, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE (lower(eo.label) LIKE '%ee%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%mumu%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%dimuon%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%dielectron%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%e+e-%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%mu+mu-%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%eμ%' OR lower(eo.label) LIKE '%μμ%') AND eo.kind IN ('channel','event_region') ORDER BY eo.paper_id, eo.kind, eo.label"}, "rows": 73, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | kind | label\n2001.06899 | hepkg:channel:dilepton_plus_jets | channel | Z(→e+e-/μ+μ-) + jet(s) final state\n2007.02873 | hepkg:region:2lep_cr_emu | event_region | 2-lepton channel"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:nonprompt-ssdilepton", "hepkg:background:others", "hepkg:background:prompt-ssdilepton", "hepkg:background:z_ll", "hepkg:channel:1l2t", "hepkg:channel:1l3t", "hepkg:channel:2l1t", "hepkg:channel:2l2t", "hepkg:channel:3l_a", 